Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, little friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.53,0:00:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Kiki.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.63,0:00:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Today the storybook opened to a page
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.72,0:00:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,full of stars Wow,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.31,0:00:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,so many stars!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.55,0:00:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiki met a little boy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.53,0:00:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,from the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.94,0:00:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.35,0:00:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,the Little Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.17,0:00:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The Little Prince lived on a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.63,0:00:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,very, very tiny planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.66,0:00:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There was only him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.94,0:00:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And... a rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.30,0:00:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This rose was so
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.07,0:00:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.17,0:00:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Red petals, so soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.24,0:00:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The Little Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.68,0:00:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,watered her every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.54,0:00:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You should drink
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.09,0:00:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,more water.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.16,0:00:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He even made a glass
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.08,0:00:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,cover for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.42,0:00:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So the wind won't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.08,0:00:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,blow on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.24,0:00:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But the rose was a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.96,0:00:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,bit spoiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.11,0:00:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so cold,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.39,0:00:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,please open the cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.74,0:00:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.06,0:00:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,the wind is too
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.71,0:00:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,strong outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.36,0:00:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.82,0:00:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,you don't care
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.13,0:00:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,about me at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.63,0:00:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The Little Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.44,0:00:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,was so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.61,0:01:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't know
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.10,0:01:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The Little Prince decided to leave
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.55,0:01:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,the planet and go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.82,0:01:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,see the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.86,0:01:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,When the rose saw him leaving,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.30,0:01:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,her petals drooped.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.85,0:01:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.70,0:01:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.77,0:01:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But Kiki saw...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.15,0:01:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,the rose secretly
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.76,0:01:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,shed a teardrop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.27,0:01:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Little Prince kept
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.36,0:01:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,looking back a few times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.36,0:01:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiki ran over and gently
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.59,0:01:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,touched the rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.17,0:01:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you miss him already?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.46,0:01:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The rose shook her head.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.85,0:01:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.77,0:01:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But her petals were
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.61,0:01:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,trembling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.58,0:01:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiki thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.95,0:01:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,My mom sometimes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.65,0:01:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,gets angry too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.24,0:01:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But she doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.61,0:01:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,really dislike me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.26,0:01:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,She just wants me to say 'I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.37,0:01:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,love you' more often.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.01,0:01:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiki called out to the Little
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.29,0:01:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince — 'Little Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.19,0:01:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't said goodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.16,0:01:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,to the rose yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.48,0:01:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The Little Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.17,0:01:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.96,0:02:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He turned around,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.17,0:02:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and gently said to the rose — 'I'm sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.12,0:02:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.09,0:02:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,listened to you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.64,0:02:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The rose's petals finally
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.82,0:02:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,stopped trembling.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.39,0:02:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.99,0:02:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,be careful on
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.34,0:02:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,your journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.69,0:02:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The Little Prince nodded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.11,0:02:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I will come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.29,0:02:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I will
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.99,0:02:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.05,0:02:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiki watched the Little
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.01,0:02:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.46,0:02:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,She thought — the people you love the most are
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.52,0:02:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,sometimes the hardest to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.15,0:02:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,speak your heart to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.51,0:02:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Little friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.80,0:02:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,who do you cherish
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.41,0:02:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,the most?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.21,0:02:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Go tell them 'I love you
